  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1293688/description_89b27ddb-6b4e-4689-abe7-a7fe5dedf832.png\"></h1><p>這是一個 <span style=\"color:#169179\">Minecraft</span> 模組，引入了 <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">celestialsapien </span>和<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"> azmuth </span>來自 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Ben 10 系列</span> 的力量，讓你能夠變身並使用其能力。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:right\"><strong>合作夥伴：<a style=\"font-weight:bold;background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faffiliate.godlike.host%252fCelestial_addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Godlike.Host</a></strong></h2>\n</div><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faffiliate.godlike.host%252fCelestial_addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1293688/description_cd73321a-5cf2-45ff-8eb6-47e39bc0cd05.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcelestialsapien\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></strong></span></h1><p>&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftrello.com%252fb%252fcYDqa3Nf%252fcelestialsapien\" rel=\"nofollow\">Trello / 維基</a></strong></h1><h2><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>依賴項：</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/threetag-palladium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Palladium</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs\" rel=\"nofollow\">KubeJS</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alienevo\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alien Evolution v1.0.6</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pehkui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pehkui</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rhino\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rhino</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cosmic-horizons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Cosmic Horizons</strong></a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>（計劃中的維度如 Nullvoid 和 Forge of creation 將在後續更新中添加）</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>合成配方：</strong></h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Null Void <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">投影器</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1293688/description_e849a21a-b892-4474-9a95-ce148c0a9261.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"362\" height=\"179\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><strong>（1.0.5 及更高版本）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">無限</span> <span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">地圖</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1293688/description_d1f941d6-31e4-4c16-b100-48b093df6f70.png\" width=\"361\" height=\"175\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><strong>（1.0.3 及更高版本）</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#34495e\">未知 DNA 黑色鏈</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1293688/description_863b93ee-f469-4a41-a26f-45e56daa6f6a.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><strong>（1.0.3 及更高版本）</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">未知 DNA 白色鏈</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1293688/description_5ff5e5ff-2bae-4482-8ac9-8e75f469a922.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><strong>（1.0.3 及更高版本）</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">未知 DNA</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1293688/description_2e234ff8-eee6-41e6-8f85-d246f0dc77a0.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#eccafa\"><strong>（1.0.3 及更高版本）</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>截圖地圖由：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eAkb2mpybnM\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChrisDaCow</a> 製作</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h3>特別感謝</h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pugmeowla/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">pugmeowla</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/moon2001satsu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Satsu the Vladat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBVvdAahUNzrqZE8flrrq5g\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timtitticus (Timmy)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ionutz16o0/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mrfox_moon\" rel=\"nofollow\">MRFOX</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/drstretch/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dr. Stretch</a></li>\n<li><a href